title Vinyl: the output muted at 640x480 (the volume group in the bottom row: the level box's muted look with the speaker-off mark alone, large: "Mute" does not fit its box at CAPTION beside the mark); "-" does nothing, "+" brings the sound back at its level
sizes 640x480
# the deck's own density (11.3 px/mm) leaves the approved 640x480 layout's touch rows 70 px, under the 7 mm (79 px):
# owner rule R-4, listed in qa-info.txt; the scene runs at a 3.5-inch 640x480 panel's 9.01 px/mm (the harness's own
# 480x640), whose 7 mm (63 px) the rows hold, the toolkit header as on the deck (56 px)
ppmm 901
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_MUTED 1

wait 1200
shot 01-now-muted
expect esc
expect notext "60"
# the mark alone (24 px or more, drawn about 60 % of the box high: the app stops a scene that breaks it); never a word
expect notext "Mute"
expect notext "Muted"
expect notext "Off"
wait 300
shot 02-now-muted-volume
# "-" while muted does nothing
tapxy 0.720 0.912
wait 300
expect notext "Mute"
expect notext "60"
# "+" brings the sound back at its level
tapxy 0.904 0.912
wait 300
shot 03-now-unmuted
expect notext "Mute"
expect text "60"
expect noquit
